{
  "name": "World-Writable Directories Have the Sticky Bit",
  "description": "Ensures every world-writable directory on local filesystems has the sticky bit set, so users cannot delete or rename other users' files in shared directories such as /tmp. Without root, unreadable directories are skipped.",
